{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟日前宣佈將逐步擴大 Windows 11 26H2 版的自動交付範圍，首批將覆蓋運行 Windows 11 25H2/24H2 且非域控設備，這些設備在符合條件的情況下將自動下載和升級到新版本，用户可能會看到系統彈出的重啓更新提示。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587210.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:24:01.939790+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:06:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.820554+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.820554+00:00","content_hash":"c93e8d24b55f9815fff6de061ac143da1b2e44ccc44096d5b2c4658c5037daa3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}